# Frontend design

Read and follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` before changing UI.

Emulocke visual direction is **onyx clamshell**: cool DS Lite chassis, inset screen wells, Gen 4 cream command chips with dark text, ivory on dark elsewhere, scarce pokeball red. Type is M PLUS Rounded 1c for display and Fira Sans for body. Not field kit. Not matte graphite pixel-UI. Not stock ImGui gray. Not purple gradients. Not Inter/Roboto/Arial/system UI fonts.

Screens sit in bezels with a hinge gap between DS panes. The suite pane is an empty SUITE chip until that product exists. Integer-scale nearest-neighbor for emulator pixels. No scanlines. No fake tracker widgets. Red is pause and destructive, not hover.
